    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "アストンマーチャン",
            "enName": "Aston Machan",
            "jpText": "……おふたりとも本当に今日が何の日か\n思い出せないですか？　ふぉーげっとですか？",
            "enText": "…You two really can't remember \nwhat today is? That forgetful, huh?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -3275300679296926426,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "…………。",
            "enText": "………",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 4610545019719068728,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アストンマーチャン",
            "enName": "Aston Machan",
            "jpText": "そして……ご用事があって、\nマーちゃんとメモリーづくりは\nできない……のですね。",
            "enText": "And… you're so busy you don't have time \nto make memories with Machan… I see.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -2715308153471584028,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "…………。",
            "enText": "………",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -5864773316116218565,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アストンマーチャン",
            "enName": "Aston Machan",
            "jpText": "それならば是非もなしです……。\nマーちゃんはお部屋に戻ります……。",
            "enText": "I guess there's nothing to be done about it \nthen… I'll just go back to my room…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 579809381279376231,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ウオッカ",
            "enName": "Vodka",
            "jpText": "――あ～……！\nやっぱこういうのは性に合わねぇ！\n構わねえよな！？　スカーレット！",
            "enText": "Ahh! I'm just not cut out for this! \nWe can drop it, right, Scarlet?!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 5413200687916529599,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "ハッピーバースデー、マーチャン！！",
            "enText": "Happy birthday, Machan!!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -2645169673123864133,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイワスカーレット",
            "enName": "Daiwa Scarlet",
            "jpText": "サプライズパーティーで驚かせるつもり\nだったんだけど準備がまだ終わってなくて……\nごめん、もうちょっと待っててね。",
            "enText": "We wanted to throw you a surprise party, \nbut we didn't get everything ready in time… \nSorry, it'll just be a little longer.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -386940695747499932,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アストンマーチャン",
            "enName": "Aston Machan",
            "jpText": "ウオッカ、スカーレット……\n嬉しいです、感激です……！！",
            "enText": "Vodka, Scarlet… This is amazing! \nI couldn't be happier!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 2957051308271210735,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アストンマーチャン",
            "enName": "Aston Machan",
            "jpText": "ちゃんと覚えていてくれたうえに、\nおふたりでそんな企画まで……！",
            "enText": "Not only did you remember my birthday, \nyou planned a party just for me…!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 8571246874383767168,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アストンマーチャン",
            "enName": "Aston Machan",
            "jpText": "あ、今のぜひ録画したいので\nもう1回お願いしますです。",
            "enText": "Oh, that would make a great video. \nDo you think you could do that again, \non camera this time?",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 8875257632054962343,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "えっ。",
            "enText": "Huh?",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
